      "originalText": "Variant — Signed in: Orvex support (restricted role).\nSame console. Can approve on a customer's behalf only\nwhere delegated; never for dangerous repairs. (FR-21;\nAmine)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
